### ======================================================================
### SPRINT 5 - GOOGLE CALENDAR + MEETING REQUESTS (MVP)
### Ejecuta en orden. Reemplaza variables de arriba.
### ======================================================================

### 0) Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 1) Desvincular Google (preparar caso "sin Google vinculado")
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/google-calendar/disconnect
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}

### 2) Intentar crear cita SIN Google vinculado (debe fallar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prospectName": "Juan Perez",
  "prospectEmail": "juan@mail.com",
  "prospectPhone": "9991234567",
  "title": "Demo CRM - sin vinculo",
  "description": "Prueba sin Google vinculado",
  "startAt": "2026-05-30T16:00:00.000Z",
  "endAt": "2026-05-30T16:30:00.000Z"
}

### 3) Obtener auth URL para vincular Google
GET {{baseUrl}}/google-calendar/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}

### 4) Abrir authUrl en navegador y autorizar.
### Luego validar estado de conexion:
GET {{baseUrl}}/google-calendar/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}

### 5) Crear cita CON Google vinculado (debe sincronizar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prospectName": "Juan Perez",
  "prospectEmail": "juan@mail.com",
  "prospectPhone": "9991234567",
  "title": "Esto es una prueba dem QA",
  "description": "Prueba de sincronizacion Sprint 6",
  "startAt": "2026-05-31T16:00:00.000Z",
  "endAt": "2026-05-31T16:30:00.000Z"
}

### Esperado:
### - HTTP 201
### - guardar _id como meetingIdA
### - googleEventId con valor
### - syncStatus = "synced"

### 6) Listar solicitudes propias
GET {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}

### 7) Ver una solicitud propia --------
GET {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests/{{meetingIdA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}

### 8) Reintento sync manual (idempotencia)
POST {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests/{{meetingIdA}}/sync-google
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Esperado:
### - HTTP 200
### - alreadySynced = true
### - no crear evento duplicado en Google Calendar

### 9) Seguridad ownership - usuario B no puede ver solicitud de A
GET {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests/{{meetingIdA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserB}}

### Esperado: 404

### 10) Seguridad ownership - usuario B no puede sincronizar solicitud de A
POST {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests/{{meetingIdA}}/sync-google
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Esperado: 404

### 11) Cancelar solicitud (usuario A)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests/{{meetingIdA}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Esperado:
### - HTTP 200
### - status = "cancelled"

### 12) Intentar sync de solicitud cancelada
POST {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests/{{meetingIdA}}/sync-google
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Esperado: 400 (no se puede sincronizar cancelada)

### 13) (Opcional) Probar anti-reuso de state OAuth
### Copia la callback URL real usada por navegador una vez exitosa, pegala
### en @googleReusedCallbackUrl y ejecuta esta request.
GET {{googleReusedCallbackUrl}}

### Esperado:
### - ok: false
### - message: "OAuth state is invalid, expired, or already used"

### 14) (Opcional - rapido) Anti-reuso usando solo state ya usado
### Paso A: ejecuta request 3 y copia el "state" del authUrl.
### Paso B: autoriza en navegador para que ese state quede consumido.
### Paso C: pega ese state en @usedState y ejecuta:
GET {{baseUrl}}/google-calendar/callback?state={{usedState}}&code=fake-code

### Esperado:
### - ok: false
### - message: "OAuth state is invalid, expired, or already used"

GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests/{{meetingIdA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserB}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests/{{meetingIdA}}/sync-google
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/meeting-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUserA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prospectName": "Refresh Test",
  "prospectEmail": "refresh@mail.com",
  "title": "Refresh token flow",
  "startAt": "2026-06-03T16:00:00.000Z",
  "endAt": "2026-06-03T16:30:00.000Z"
}